  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/04/IMG_4638.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La torr&aacute; de la sardina puso fin anoche a una jornada eminentemente gastron&oacute;mica en las fiestas del barrio de la Morer&iacute;a de Onda, que hab&iacute;a comenzado por la ma&ntilde;ana con el almuerzo ofrecido por la carnicer&iacute;a Batiste. Por la tarde, como en todas las que no hay toros, hubo chocolotada patrocinada por el bar Geyser.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torrasardinamoreria/img_4632.jpg\" alt=\"img_4632\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torrasardinamoreria/img_4633.jpg\" alt=\"img_4633\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torrasardinamoreria/img_4634.jpg\" alt=\"img_4634\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torrasardinamoreria/img_4635.jpg\" alt=\"img_4635\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torrasardinamoreria/img_4636.jpg\" alt=\"img_4636\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torrasardinamoreria/img_4637.jpg\" alt=\"img_4637\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torrasardinamoreria/img_4638.jpg\" alt=\"img_4638\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torrasardinamoreria/img_4639.jpg\" alt=\"img_4639\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torrasardinamoreria/img_4640.jpg\" alt=\"img_4640\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\